      "description": {
        "fun": "A lonely spirit that possessed a cold, leftover cup of tea. It hopes you'll drink it so it can sap your life force from inside, but it tastes so awful it's always spat straight out. Most Sinistea live in fake antique cups; the rare genuine ones carry a maker's stamp underneath, and some collectors brew the perfect tea hoping to attract one.",
        "guide": "A Ghost-type Pokémon formed when a lonely spirit possesses leftover tea in a teacup. Most Sinistea are Phony Form, in forged cups; rare Antique Form ones have a stamp of authenticity. It evolves into Polteageist with a Cracked Pot or a Chipped Pot.",
