      "description": {
        "fun": "A ghost made entirely of black tea, living in a cracked teapot. Its tea tastes delicious but sends chills through anyone who drinks it, and too much can be fatal; some daring gourmets drink it daily anyway. It multiplies by creeping into teapots and pouring itself into leftover tea, and its personality depends on the tea, not the pot.",
        "guide": "The evolution of Sinistea, a ghost made of black tea living in an old teapot. Its tea tastes good but causes chills and is dangerous in excess. Like Sinistea it comes in Phony and Antique forms, and it is unrelated to the lookalike Sinistcha.",
